# Track Upcoming Features in README Todo

When discussing or agreeing on **upcoming features**, **new mission types**, or **significant changes** to this project, add them to the **Todo** section of **README.md** (project root).

- Keep each item concise but enough to implement from later.
- Use bullet sub-points for multi-part items (e.g. AO mission, AI JTAC).
- This keeps a single place for planned work and avoids losing ideas across conversations.
